# API keys the user must fill in

When the user asks to point out API keys they need to fill out or provide to make this project functional:

1. Search the repo for the keyword `api_key` (case-insensitive if needed).
2. List every file that contains `api_key`, with enough context (variable names, env vars, comments) so they know what to fill.
3. Do not invent extra keys that are not present as `api_key` in the codebase.
